cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "WattWitness: explainable trust checks for microgrid telemetry"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-15
authors:
  - name: "WattWitness team"
abstract: >-
  Phase 1 prototype for the EnergyMind Tunisia challenge: a one-year simulated
  microgrid node with modelled meter error, controlled fault injection, physics
  cross-checks with limits learned from training data, explained alerts and
  human review.
keywords:
  - microgrid
  - data quality
  - anomaly detection
  - explainability
  - human oversight
license: MIT
